stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: 创建任务
    pending --> approved: 审核通过
    pending --> rejected: 审核驳回
    approved --> open: 发布成功
    open --> accepted: 被接单
    accepted --> completion_pending: 一方确认完成
    completion_pending --> completed: 双方确认完成
    completed --> [*]: 进入评价
    open --> canceled: 发布者取消
    accepted --> canceled: 取消接单/取消任务
    pending --> canceled: 审核超时取消
    open --> expired: 超时未接单自动取消